OL,3,AHouthis warn airlines and passengers
OL,4,Anot to use Saudi Arabian airports after
OL,5,Adeadly Riyadh attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FYemen's Houthis warn aviation firms and
OL,8,Fpassengers against using Saudi airports
OL,9,Fand airspace, after 12 people were
OL,10,Fkilled in an attack on the
OL,11,Finternational airport in Riyadh
OL,13,FMore than 300 were injured in
OL,14,FSaturday's attack on King Khalid
OL,15,FInternational Airport in Saudi Arabia -
OL,16,Fverified footage captures the aftermath
OL,17,Fof the strike
