OL,3,AHouthis warn airlines and passengers
OL,4,Anot to use Saudi Arabian airports after
OL,5,Adeadly Riyadh attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Houthi statement on Sunday did not
OL,8,Freference Saturday's attack - but the
OL,9,FIran-backed group said they were behind
OL,10,Fseparate strikes on the same airport on
OL,11,FThursday
OL,13,FUK Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,14,Fsuggests the UK could "potentially"
OL,15,Fprovide more support for Saudi Arabia
OL,16,Fwhile US President Donald Trump says
OL,17,Fthe US may get involved in offensive
OL,18,Fstrikes
